c scenes."}]}, {"id": "99156709-e79a-4572-94f9-40384b329ca2", "type": "topic", "title": "Extended Conversation Practice", "description": "Students build the stamina to sustain unscripted Spanish across longer exchanges. The focus is fluency, repair strategies, follow-up questions, pronunciation, and interactional confidence.", "children": [{"id": "337ebb8e-4a65-4908-8ec3-486703e9d1ab", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Conversation management", "children": [{"id": "4d51e773-57c5-40c0-a07f-6962ef13c17c", "type": "concept", "title": "follow-up questions"}, {"id": "1bb4ca69-e933-4338-8595-c5ee969fa3ee", "type": "concept", "title": "clarification"}, {"id": "a812c160-afc2-497e-8051-dfd7192ea1d7", "type": "concept", "title": "turn-taking"}, {"id": "d5a4825b-4563-4883-8fe9-5107f75d44c9", "type": "concept", "title": "repair phrases"}], "description": "Keep a conversation alive by asking, clarifying, reacting, and redirecting."}, {"id": "a2430130-f40f-4246-bcc4-b2f93da197b6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Fluency and pronunciation", "children": [{"id": "2ccef700-ff7f-4d80-841e-0061ef5acea7", "type": "concept", "title": "stress"}, {"id": "b6bb9cd0-ac66-44a4-a996-c646b6eff7d8", "type": "concept", "title": "intonation"}, {"id": "361567b6-c4cf-4dd4-8f5d-39933b64cd75", "type": "concept", "title": "linking"}, {"id": "f29cac07-e874-4d98-8af6-3c09fa6e45d9", "type": "concept", "title": "self-monitoring"}], "description": "Increase speed and naturalness while maintaining comprehensibility."}, {"id": "085b5939-cdf9-48dc-b255-367e6de7cec7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Discussion leadership", "children": [{"id": "f18f8904-81c4-446e-9e96-34e4b6916331", "type": "concept", "title": "opening questions"}, {"id": "57662043-1b41-41bd-9252-1d85c79dcaec", "type": "concept", "title": "summarizing"}, {"id": "d833003e-b61f-497a-a266-e5346f151589", "type": "concept", "title": "inviting participation"}, {"id": "adad4227-6620-43a6-82dd-eae1733c1a06", "type": "concept", "title": "transition phrases"}], "d