9cf82-4a8c-41ea-8349-42d2bc84fd10", "type": "concept", "title": "connectors"}], "description": "Build paragraphs with topic sentences, evidence, commentary, and transitions."}, {"id": "18f520e1-ca2f-470d-ae18-1f58223ed279", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Revision and peer review", "children": [{"id": "26555b00-0729-42d7-8869-88ebe2a2f4d8", "type": "concept", "title": "revision memo"}, {"id": "8a364804-55cf-41bd-9d87-a1a6dde3adea", "type": "concept", "title": "peer workshop"}, {"id": "f776a76a-43a7-4a6e-a489-d6124f0d26de", "type": "concept", "title": "global revision"}, {"id": "f0fb5bf1-2fc1-49c6-85a9-1e1f91a79622", "type": "concept", "title": "local editing"}], "description": "Use feedback to strengthen argument, organization, grammar, and tone."}, {"id": "11c4bd91-8bd5-4751-835e-31f36b753b3f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Editing, citation, and language tools", "children": [{"id": "32358337-f6b3-410c-9008-22810c51eb93", "type": "concept", "title": "MLA basics"}, {"id": "47628495-d0ba-4576-88fb-e4491e523807", "type": "concept", "title": "paraphrase"}, {"id": "f49042bf-e021-451d-8bd2-47da35db2d03", "type": "concept", "title": "quoted evidence"}, {"id": "3a8b1666-2b74-43ac-b17b-c8a78975c24a", "type": "concept", "title": "tool-use policy"}], "description": "Practice responsible source use and transparent boundaries around translation and AI tools."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$isp2json$::jsonb,
